REBUILD ONLY MACHINE PLACEMENT/CONVEYOR AS FOLLOWS:
1. Main black rubber conveyor runs from bottom center toward the Pit at top center. Move Auto-Collector 1 from its old lower-left location to the BOTTOM START of the main vertical belt, centered in line with the belt. Its perforated metal worktop feeds directly forward through an OPEN downhill silver chute onto the start of the black rubber belt. A spinning blue motor with gold gear is clearly attached to its side. SHOW AN UNOBSTRUCTED FLAT TRANSFER from chute to belt, zero wall, zero crossbar. No separate side connection for this collector.
2. Auto-Collector 2 sits LEFT of the lower-middle main belt, has the same attached blue motor and gold gear, and feeds a short HORIZONTAL BLACK RUBBER FEEDER BELT pointing right into main belt at a perpendicular T-JUNCTION. Make the junction a single flat BLACK RUBBER T-SHAPED SURFACE, with a full feeder-width OPEN GAP cut out of the main conveyor's left blue side rail. At the intersection black rubber visibly meets black rubber at the SAME HEIGHT with no obstacle. The side rail STOPS before the feeder and resumes after it. A yellow duck rides across the center of this OPEN gap, demonstrating uninterrupted travel from feeder to main belt. Do not use a sloped chute hitting a side wall. Keep blue rails only on external long edges, NEVER across any end or junction.
3. Blue paint U arch labeled "×2" stands halfway up main belt, with both pillars on FLOOR OUTSIDE blue side rails. Empty open tunnel with continuous flat rubber underneath, spray transforms yellow ducks below to blue ducks above.
4. Top end of main belt is OPEN and overhangs INSIDE the Pit, ducks drop straight off exposed black roller edge into Pit. No gate or rail across top or bottom ends.

REMOVE ENTIRELY: ALL blue billboard names and their upright signposts mounted onto collectors/workbenches. BOTH machines are plain industrial furniture with perforated tabletops and motors, NO "Сборщик 1", NO "Авто-сборщик 2", NO names, NO blank sign panels, NO sign poles. Keep ONLY floating screen UI and the arch ×2 badge. Do not add annotations to the art.
ABSOLUTE NEGATIVE: NO yellow end caps, NO yellow bumpers, NO transverse yellow or blue rail across rubber travel path, NO wall at either conveyor end, NO wall at T-junction, NO billboard signs or posts on furniture. Yellow corner details may appear on TABLE corners only. End faces of conveyors show exposed BLACK ROLLER, never a colored crossbar.`;
